# Wave W17-W (Route 211): lotus pine — a bluff pine in still blue-greens, tiered and full, its crown unbent in the bluff’s still air with the highlight lifted clear of the turf, on lotus turf (ground baked in). Route 211’s own tree — split from Route 205’s wind-bent gale pine by posture entire (still vs bent) and from Route 208’s warm rest pine by crown temperature: the bluff pine stands in cool meditation air, the rest pine in warm foothill ease.
